      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STEELY DAWN (2) flew the lids from the middle with a slick turn of foot before finishing second (23.62) and beaten 2 lengths over 411m at this track. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Must come into calculations. LAST RUPEE (1) goes very well this course and distance starting 30 times for 11 wins and seven minors. Below best last time at this track (24.10) in a NG, finishing a 9 length seventh. Looks one of the chances. KINGSBRAE NOLA (7) has found the frame here at the last couple of runs when prominent throughout, most recently when third beaten 3.5 lengths (23.71). Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Likely to be in the finish again. REALITY ZERO (3) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
